WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.975
Microsoft's size and scale page sets four
thousand clients per distribution point.

2
00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:08.263
Seventy thousand endpoints
need eighteen at the ceiling,

3
00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:09.975
and twenty-four with headroom.

4
00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:14.503
The other fourteen hundred seventy-six
compensate for slow branch circuits,

5
00:00:14.503 --> 00:00:16.837
and content has since moved to the cloud.

6
00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:18.137
Timing matters too.

7
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:21.907
Microsoft has moved Configuration
Manager to an annual release

8
00:00:21.907 --> 00:00:25.537
cadence and says new device
management work happens in Intune.

9
00:00:25.537 --> 00:00:29.967
Hardware bought this fiscal year
depreciates through fiscal 2031,

10
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:33.051
so a refresh can outlive
the platform it serves.

11
00:00:33.051 --> 00:00:34.637
The role isn't obsolete.

12
00:00:34.637 --> 00:00:37.390
The distribution point at every office is.
